WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.524 --> 00:00:18.751
A few miles down the road, Willie and his grandfather brought me to a halt in front of

2
00:00:18.791 --> 00:00:19.571
a pretty cottage.

3
00:00:20.952 --> 00:00:23.353
The farmer went to the door while Willie stayed with me.

4
00:00:25.254 --> 00:00:26.754
Three ladies came out of the house.

5
00:00:27.935 --> 00:00:29.916
One was tall and pale and wrapped in a shawl.

6
00:00:31.068 --> 00:00:34.911
She was leaning on the arm of a younger lady with dark eyes and a cheerful face.

7
00:00:36.573 --> 00:00:38.975
The third lady was tall with a kind smile.

8
00:00:39.976 --> 00:00:41.317
They all came over to see me.

9
00:00:42.978 --> 00:00:47.682
The cheerful younger lady, whose name was Miss Ellen, seemed to take to me right away.

10
00:00:47.702 --> 00:00:52.006
"He has a good face," she said, giving me a pat.

11
00:00:52.026 --> 00:00:53.748
"I like him already!"

12
00:00:55.329 --> 00:00:58.612
The tall, pale lady, Miss Lavinia, glanced at my knees.

13
00:00:59.764 --> 00:01:01.825
"I don't know," she said.

14
00:01:01.845 --> 00:01:06.966
"I'd always be nervous riding behind a horse that's fallen down before."

15
00:01:06.986 --> 00:01:13.528
"Many fine horses have scars on their knees, thanks to careless drivers," the farmer said.

16
00:01:13.548 --> 00:01:17.289
"I suspect that's what happened to this horse.

17
00:01:18.189 --> 00:01:20.250
But I don't blame you for being cautious.

18
00:01:21.450 --> 00:01:25.571
If you like, you can take him on trial for a while and see what your coachman thinks

19
00:01:25.651 --> 00:01:25.911
of him."

20
00:01:27.111 --> 00:01:28.892
The tall lady, Miss Blomefield, nodded.

21
00:01:30.412 --> 00:01:34.015
"You've never steered us wrong on a horse yet," she told the farmer.

22
00:01:34.035 --> 00:01:38.077
"If my sisters agree, we'll gladly give him a try."

23
00:01:38.097 --> 00:01:42.720
The next day a handsome young man arrived to pick me up.

24
00:01:44.101 --> 00:01:45.342
At first he looked pleased.

25
00:01:46.523 --> 00:01:48.985
Then he saw my knees and his expression changed.

26
00:01:51.006 --> 00:01:54.608
"I didn't think you'd recommend a blemished horse to the ladies, sir," he told the farmer.

27
00:01:54.628 --> 00:01:59.632
"I know you're a good judge of horses, young man," the farmer replied.

28
00:02:00.768 --> 00:02:02.309
"Just give him a fair trial.

29
00:02:03.050 --> 00:02:06.812
I think you'll see that he's the safest horse you could want for your ladies."

30
00:02:08.413 --> 00:02:10.855
The young man agreed and led me back to the ladies' home.

31
00:02:12.376 --> 00:02:13.977
I was put into a comfortable stall.

32
00:02:15.918 --> 00:02:18.140
The young man fed me and left me to rest.

33
00:02:20.081 --> 00:02:24.464
The next day, after I'd finished my breakfast, he took me out of my stall and started to

34
00:02:24.484 --> 00:02:24.904
groom me.

35
00:02:26.505 --> 00:02:29.988
He pushed aside my forelock to brush my face, and then stopped.

36
00:02:31.756 --> 00:02:34.637
"That looks just like the star Black Beauty had," he murmured.

37
00:02:34.657 --> 00:02:37.458
"This horse is about the same height too.

38
00:02:38.279 --> 00:02:39.559
I wonder where old Beauty is now."

39
00:02:41.400 --> 00:02:42.721
He continued with his grooming.

40
00:02:45.782 --> 00:02:48.583
Soon he came to the little knot I'd had in my neck for years.

41
00:02:49.543 --> 00:02:50.584
The groom looked startled.

42
00:02:52.305 --> 00:02:56.006
He began to look me over carefully, talking to himself all the while.

43
00:02:56.026 --> 00:03:05.237
"White star, one white foot, this little knot just in that spot I can't believe it, here's the

44
00:03:05.257 --> 00:03:07.018
little patch of white hair on his back too!

45
00:03:07.398 --> 00:03:08.598
Oh Beauty, it is you!

46
00:03:10.119 --> 00:03:11.359
Black Beauty, do you remember me?

47
00:03:12.579 --> 00:03:14.420
It's Joe, Little Joe Green!"

48
00:03:15.880 --> 00:03:18.681
He began patting me all over, laughing with delight.

49
00:03:20.882 --> 00:03:23.942
I can't say I would have recognized him, all grown up as he was.

50
00:03:26.403 --> 00:03:29.324
I put my nose up to him to show him that I knew we were friends.

51
00:03:31.128 --> 00:03:32.288
"Give you a fair trial!"

52
00:03:32.628 --> 00:03:34.229
Little Joe exclaimed with a laugh.

53
00:03:34.249 --> 00:03:35.689
"I should think so!

54
00:03:37.190 --> 00:03:39.010
I wonder who ruined your knees, my old Beauty.

55
00:03:40.151 --> 00:03:42.191
You must have had some hard times somewhere along the way.

56
00:03:43.332 --> 00:03:46.272
But you'll have only the best from now on if I have anything to do with it!

57
00:03:47.473 --> 00:03:49.253
I only wish John Manly were here to see you."

58
00:03:51.674 --> 00:03:54.195
That afternoon Little Joe harnessed me and brought me to the house.

59
00:03:55.555 --> 00:03:58.876
Miss Ellen came out to try me, with Little Joe riding along.

60
00:04:01.544 --> 00:04:04.366
She was a good driver and seemed pleased with my paces.

61
00:04:05.527 --> 00:04:09.370
Little Joe told her that he was sure I was Squire Gordon's old Black Beauty.

62
00:04:11.071 --> 00:04:14.474
When we returned, Miss Ellen told her sisters all about it.

63
00:04:14.494 --> 00:04:16.455
"I'll write to Mrs.

64
00:04:16.515 --> 00:04:20.659
Gordon right away and let her know her favorite horse has come to us," she said.

65
00:04:20.679 --> 00:04:23.561
"She'll be so happy to hear it!"

66
00:04:25.062 --> 00:04:27.484
The sisters drove me every day for the next week.

67
00:04:30.192 --> 00:04:33.593
Even Miss Lavinia finally found the courage to ride along with the others.

68
00:04:35.093 --> 00:04:38.294
They decided to keep me and call me by my old name of Black Beauty.

69
00:04:39.695 --> 00:04:43.716
That was a year ago, and I'm still with them and as happy as I've ever been.

70
00:04:45.196 --> 00:04:47.237
Little Joe and the ladies treat me kindly.

71
00:04:49.257 --> 00:04:52.718
My work is easy and pleasant, and my strength and spirits are back.

72
00:04:56.139 --> 00:05:00.793
Willie and his grandfather come to visit often, and the ladies have promised never to sell me.

73
00:05:03.795 --> 00:05:05.496
And so this is where my story ends.

74
00:05:06.496 --> 00:05:08.858
My troubles are all over, and I am at home.

75
00:05:10.599 --> 00:05:16.182
Often, before I am quite awake, I imagine that I am still in the orchard at Birtwick Park,

76
00:05:17.422 --> 00:05:20.004
standing with my old friends under the apple trees.
